Parts of this extension are ported from the REDAXO add-on “consent_kit”
(https://github.com/FriendsOfREDAXO/consent_kit, version 1.0.0-beta3, commit f4777e7),
which is licensed under the MIT License reproduced below. The ported parts are: the service
templates in presets/*.json and presets/FORMAT.md, the web component (assets/js/consent-ui.mjs,
assets/js/consent.js, assets/css/consent.css), the frontend texts (lang/site/en.php) and the
PHP logic in src/ (Compiler, Events, Presets, Log, PublicController). See THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

